        <activityName xml:lang="en">Surface treatment, outer door, natural, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Surface treatment, outer door, natural, at plant
The measures of the visible door leaf are 1m x 2m. The door and corresponding frame are painted. The bill of materials is based on data from door manufactures.;
UUID: 71c7223c-5095-3052-a3a7-ba3142a20ca7
Included are the materials used for the surface treatment (natural) of the outer door leaf and the door frame. Production losses and transport of the materials are included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data survey at 4 door manufactures in Switzerland. 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_71c7223c-5095-3052-a3a7-ba3142a20ca7.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
